# Training scratch. Trained weights under artifacts/ ARE committed for now -
# they are small (~140 KB) and reproducibility matters more than repo size at
# this scale. Revisit if a vision model starts producing 100 MB checkpoints:
# at that point use Git LFS or an object store, not git.
runs/
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
checkpoints/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.h5

